  "extract_html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"ib-wrap\" style=\"width:420px\">\n   \n<aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-black pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"Box title\">Absorbing Regeneration</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/7/76/Imhotep_Feeds.gif/revision/latest?cb=20180531223949\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Imhotep Feeds\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/7/76/Imhotep_Feeds.gif/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/350?cb=20180531223949\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/7/76/Imhotep_Feeds.gif/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/350?cb=20180531223949 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/powerlisting/images/7/76/Imhotep_Feeds.gif/revision/latest?cb=20180531223949 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Imhotep Feeds\" width=\"270\" height=\"115\" data-image-key=\"Imhotep_Feeds.gif\" data-image-name=\"Imhotep Feeds.gif\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Imhotep (The Mummy) assimilates the organs and fluids of those who opened a chest containing The Book Of The Dead to regenerate himself.</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Row 1 info\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Power/Ability to:</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Absorb different things to empower regeneration.</div>\n</div>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<p>The power to <b>absorb a variety of things to regenerate</b>. Combination of <a href=\"/wiki/Absorption\" title=\"Absorption\">Absorption</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Regenerative_Healing_Factor\" title=\"Regenerative Healing Factor\">Regenerative Healing Factor</a>. Not to be confused with <a href=\"/wiki/Mimetic_Regeneration\" title=\"Mimetic Regeneration\">Mimetic Regeneration</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Also_Called\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Also Called</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Capabilities\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Capabilities</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Applications\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Applications</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Variations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Variations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Limitations\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Limitations</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Known_Users\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Users</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Known_Objects\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Known Objects</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Gallery\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Gallery</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Videos\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Videos</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Also_Called\">Also Called</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsorbing_Regeneration%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>Absorption Regeneration</li>\n<li>Assimilative Regeneration</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Capabilities\">Capabilities</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsorbing_Regeneration%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The user can absorb anything (<a href=\"/wiki/Energy_Absorption\" title=\"Energy Absorption\">energy</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Matter_Absorption\" title=\"Matter Absorption\">matter</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Biological_Absorption\" title=\"Biological Absorption\">biomass</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Absorption\" title=\"Elemental Absorption\">elements</a>, etc.) to regenerate their bodies, with the amount absorbed defining the strength and speed of regeneration.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Applications\">Applications</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsorbing_Regeneration%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption\" title=\"Absorption\">Absorption</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Regenerative_Healing_Factor\" title=\"Regenerative Healing Factor\">Regenerative Healing Factor</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Variations\">Variations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsorbing_Regeneration%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D4&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Consumption_Healing\" title=\"Consumption Healing\">Consumption Healing</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Cosmic_Regeneration\" title=\"Cosmic Regeneration\">Cosmic Regeneration</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Inorganic_Regeneration\" title=\"Inorganic Regeneration\">Inorganic Regeneration</a>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Artificial_Element_Regeneration\" title=\"Artificial Element Regeneration\">Artificial Element Regeneration</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Elemental_Regeneration\" title=\"Elemental Regeneration\">Elemental Regeneration</a></li></ul></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Organic_Regeneration\" title=\"Organic Regeneration\">Organic Regeneration</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/Stellar_Regeneration\" title=\"Stellar Regeneration\">Stellar Regeneration</a></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Limitations\">Limitations</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsorbing_Regeneration%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D5&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Immunity\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Absorption Immunity\">Absorption Immunity</a>/<a href=\"/wiki/Absorption_Negation\" title=\"Absorption Negation\">Absorption Negation</a></li>\n<li>May be limited to how much one can absorb.</li>\n<li>Rate of regeneration is dependent on available resource to absorb.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Known_Users\">Known Users</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fpowerlisting.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAbsorbing_Regeneration%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D6&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"scrollable\" style=\"overflow:auto; max-height:275px; width:100%; -moz-border-radius-topleft:0.5em; border:1px solid #AAAAAA; padding-left:0.5em; background:transparent;\">\n<ul><li>Colossi/Silver Colossi/Gold Colossi (<i>Age of Mythology</i>)</li>\n<li>Michael Morningstar/Darkstar (<i>Ben 10</i>)</li>\n<li>Shaz Domino (<i>Bleach</i>)</li>\n<li>Kazuki Muto (<i>Buso Renkin</i>)</li>\n<li>Victor Powered (<i>Buso Renkin</i>)</li>\n<li>Priscilla (<i>Claymore</i>)</li>\n<li>Riful (<i>Claymore</i>)</li>\n<li>Mutants (<i>Command &amp; Conquer</i>)</li>\n<li>Scrin (<i>Command &amp; Conquer</i>)</li>\n<li>Tiberium wildlife (<i>Command &amp; Conquer</i>)</li>\n<li>Conduits (<i>Infamous</i>)</li>\n<li>Zeiram (<i>Iria: Zeiram the Animation</i>)</li>\n<li>Dio Brando/DIO (<i>JoJo's Bizarre Adventure</i>)</li>\n<li>Yuya Fungami (<i>JoJo's Bizarre Adventure</i>); via Highway Star</li>\n<li>Akuma Shogun (<i>Kinnikuman</i>)</li>\n<li>Auditor (<i>Madness Combat</i>)</li>\n<li>Melody Jacobs/Threnody (<i>Marvel Comics</i>)</li>\n<li>Samus Aran (<i>Metroid</i>)</li>\n<li>Imhotep (<i>The Mummy</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://naruto.fandom.com/wiki/J%C5%ABgo\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:naruto:Jūgo\">Jūgo</a> (<i>Naruto</i>)</li>\n<li>Kisame Hoshigaki (<i>Naruto</i>)</li>\n<li>Mukade (<i>Naruto Shippuden the Movie: The Lost Tower</i>)</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://marvelcinematicuniverse.fandom.com/wiki/Agatha_Harkness\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:c:marvelcinematicuniverse:Agatha Harkness\"